.TH tkujson n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkujson \- JSON tree viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkujson
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkujson::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on tclutils::tujson::parseTyped (tclutils 0.28.0+). Shows JSON
as a nested tree distinguishing objects, arrays and scalars. See docs/tkujson.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, json
